## Additional Validation – Email Not Registered

An additional validation was performed using an email address that does not exist in the system.

Test Scenario

Open the Password Recovery page.
Enter an unregistered email address.
Submit the password recovery request.

Expected Result

The system should reject the request and display an error message indicating that no account exists for the provided email address.

Actual Result

The application correctly rejected the request and displayed an appropriate error message informing the user that no account was associated with the entered email address.

Status: PASS

